{#dogfood}
# Dogfood

This site is the demo: it is authored in Carve, built by CarvePress, and deployed to GitHub Pages at [the published site](https://markup-carve.github.io/carve-press/).

Start with [Getting Started](/guide/getting-started), then use [Carve Syntax](/guide/carve-syntax) to check the markup rules that differ from Markdown.

::: note "For assistants"
Generated `llms.txt` is enabled for this site, so an assistant can read a compact route list instead of crawling the HTML.
:::
